---
const stats = [
  ['CFA', 'Charterholder-designed'],
  ['~20 yrs', 'In global markets'],
  ['60 min', 'One focused session'],
]
---
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
    <span class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black/50 mb-5">
      <span class="h-px w-6 bg-[#FFBD40]"></span>
      Why The Money Wit
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl text-black">Taught by a CFA Charterholder with almost 20 years in Nigerian and global markets.</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-black/60">
      The Money Wit is an expert financial education ecosystem for individuals and organisations. This masterclass applies the same framework used in professional markets to help everyday Nigerians invest with clarity not guesswork.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
      {stats.map(([big, small]) => (
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-black/10 p-6">
          <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#FFBD40]">{big}</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-black/40">{small}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
